  "description": "Original PNG: M-only points P/E; common points C/D; N-only points K/X/S. Exactly SEVEN named points. Small stray ink above M is a scan mark, not a labelled set member.",
  "source": {
    "image": {
      "path": "ssot-resources/soviet10year-textbooks/artifacts/5m/figures/fig-06-2.png",
      "sha256": "4ee27f94b711ed9dc0ddb079a1d1ff2af6cfef90b73cc55f4791aaa97a52ec8f"
